<title>UK: London extends offer for Capital Corp.</title>
<headline>London extends offer for Capital Corp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Clubs International said on Wednesday that it has received acceptances for its hostile bid for Capital Corp Plc representing 2.88 percent of Capital's share capital by March 25.</p>
<p>London Clubs has extended the offer for the British gaming company until April 8, 1997.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
